ng walk: relaxed shoulders, a soft midweight heft, and a collar that keeps its shape. Wear it with faded denim, layered under a coat, or draped over a linen dress. The stitched accents give a subtle, artisanal touch that stands out without shouting, and the tear-away neck label keeps the inside as comfortable as the outside.<br/><br/>Product features<br/>- Embroidered accents at chest, back, and optional wrist placements<br/>- Midweight 50/50 cotton-poly blend (8.0 oz/yd²) for warmth and durability<br/>- Tubular knit (no side seams) for cleaner drape and reduced waste<br/>- Ribbed knit collar and double-needle stitching for long-lasting shape<br/>- DTF inner neck labels; OEKO-TEX® certified dyes and ethically grown US cotton<br/><br/>Care instructions<br/>- Machine wash: cold (max 30C or 90F)<br/>- Non-chlorine: bleach as needed<br/>- Tumble dry: low heat<br/>- Do not dryclean<br/>- Do not iron<br/>","supplierPrice":36.99,"supplierProductId":"6ac5349aeeae231e00050f12","options":[]}],"contactSubmissions":[],"storeOrders":[{"id":"ord-sample-1","items":[{"qty":1,"name":"TURKMEN SILK-INSPIRED SHIRT","size":"L","slug":"turkmen-silk-shirt","color":"Raw Silk","image":"/images/look-1.jpg","price":285}],"total":285,"status":"New","customer":{"city":"Amsterdam","email":"alexander.dejong@example.nl","phone":"+31 6 1122 3344","street":"Herengracht 142","country":"Netherlands","lastName":"de Jong","firstName":"Alexander","postalCode":"1015 BN"},"shipping":0,"subtotal":285,"createdAt":"2026-10-05T09:15:00Z","orderNumber":"YPK-2026-7821","paymentMethod":"iDEAL","deliveryMethod":"Standard Courier","emailNotificationSent":true,"emailNotificationRecipient":"daniyarow16@gmail.com"}],"_reset":true,"updatedAt":"2026-10-06T18:32:56.910645+00:00"}